    "summary": "American drummer of Frank Zappa's band (1975-78), U.K. (1978-80) and Missing Persons (1980-86), which he co-founded and wrote for; then a solo drummer composing ostinato pieces on a huge tuned kit. Zappa wrote The Black Page for him. Raised on Appice, Mitchell and Baker, later Elvin Jones and Tony Williams; schooled in percussion and timpani. Modern Drummer Hall of Fame, 1997."
  },
